        "text": "theorem addBlock_waveBounds {s : StripData D} {P : ℕ → D → ℝ} {α β : ℝ}\n    {a b : HarmonicBlock D} (ha : a.WaveBounds s P α) (hb : b.WaveBounds s P β)\n    (hαβ : α ≤ β) : (addBlock a b).WaveBounds s P α"
